From 61f7fb58d7835b00d8080c29081ec95a1cb57c04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Wagner-Hall <dawagner@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Dec 2024 10:27:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] workspace: Pay attention to members

Previously we were ignoring this field and always doing auto-discovery.

Cargo only does auto-discovery if this field is not set.
